ard (G7, H4, H7). I hold a commanding lead, controlling almost the entire board, including the top edge and all corners.\nEvaluation: My only valid move is at G7. Placing a piece here will sandwich the opponent's vertical line of pieces from B7 to F7 between my new piece at G7 and my existing piece at A7. This will flip five opponent pieces to my color.\nReason: Since (G,7) is the only legal move available to me, I must play it. It further increases my overwhelming piece count and leads the game towards its conclusion.\nAnswer: (G,7)"}
